{"duration_api_ms":271202,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c4485537-5475-46ab-8dfd-402ddb44797b","total_cost_usd":0.309772,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13012,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":25772,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":20040},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13012,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":25772,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13012,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13012},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":25772,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":13012,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.309772,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":20040,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is a tight cluster at D≈3.0-3.3 m, bluntness 1.0-1.2, cone 68-70°, gamma -2 to -3.5°, with flux 283-300 kW/m² and bondline T 396-419 K. Hypervolume is about 0.32, and it is limited mainly by T: the normalised T axis (300-450 K) has far more room than the flux axis (reference 2.5 MW/m²). From the data I fitted rough local trends: T falls about 17 K per metre of D, about 0.8 K per 0.1 of bluntness, and about 11.7 K per degree of steepening gamma. Flux falls roughly as D^-1.45 and drops about 8%/deg with shallower gamma. max_g depends almost only on gamma (about 11.83 at gamma -3.5, D 3.25), so the limit of 12 caps gamma near -3.58. Heatshield mass fraction scales as D², with 1-margin ≈ 0.79*(D/3)², so D is capped near 3.37 m. Cone angle affects T, flux and g very little but is best at 70°. All 8 geometry failures have cone angle too small for the bluntness, which suggests a bluntness limit that shrinks as the cone gets shallower. This is an inference, not verified.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-19d65f7d82f4 (D3.25, bl1.0, c69, g-3.5): T 395.58 and flux 300k with mass margin 0.072. C-bd65eb0949c1 (D3.3, g-3.3): margin 0.042. Mass margin therefore hits zero near D≈3.37.\",\"C-29603553ab30 (g-2.0): flux 283k, T 418.8. C-aa9546beae98 (g-2.4): T 414.5. C-ec050d7f0c55 (g-3.5): T 401.4 at D3.0. So T drops about 11-12 K per degree of steepening, at the cost of higher flux and g.\",\"max_g at g-3.5 is 11.61 (D2.7), 11.74 (D3.0) and 11.83 (D3.25), while cone 62/66/70 at D3.0 give identical g (C-7e855dcecd98, C-ec050d7f0c55, C-5eac89a9568b). g is set by gamma, with a weak D effect.\",\"Higher bluntness lowers both objectives slightly: C-268997241f64 (bl1.2, D3.1, g-3.4) has flux 307k and T 398.1, versus C-31cee390321b (bl1.1, c69.5) at 312.6k and 398.8.\",\"Infeasible steep-entry points (C-36f9165b9496, C-ab9827dc6929) gain little T (T≈398-403) but break max_g. Small-D points have high flux. The high-D, high-bluntness corner is therefore the best region.\",\"All 8 geometry failures have a small cone angle for their bluntness, e.g. C-2e989122c857 (bl0.97, c59.8) and C-7fd3f4505944 (bl0.75, c36). Every point with c≥62 and bl≤1.2 was valid, so I keep c=70 with bl≤1.25.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Bondline T is driven by the heat pulse. A larger D lowers the ballistic coefficient, so peak heating occurs higher in the atmosphere and is lower. A steeper gamma shortens the pulse but raises g. The g limit of 12 fixes gamma at about -3.55, and the mass-fraction limit fixes D at about 3.35-3.37. A larger nose radius (bluntness) and a high cone angle reduce stagnation flux without changing g. The optimum T is therefore at the corner D≈3.35, bl 1.2, c70, gamma≈-3.5, near about 392 K and 279 kW/m². Since flux is cheap in hypervolume terms, I also spread points along the front with shallower gamma at D≈3.35 (lower flux, higher T) to cover the trade-off.\",\"uncertainty\":\"All numbers are extrapolations from local trends. D≥3.36 could violate mass fraction if my scaling is off, and gamma≤-3.55 could violate g at large D. Bluntness 1.25 at c70 is beyond the tested range and could be an invalid geometry. Shallow-gamma flux and T predictions rely on interpolation between D3.0 data and the fitted D scaling.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"Corner design: push D to 3.35, bl 1.2, c70 at gamma -3.5, where g is about 11.86 and mass margin about 0.015.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Most likely to dominate the current front on both objectives.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"Same as the corner design but gamma -3.55 for about 0.6 K less T while staying just under g=12.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":280000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests how much of the g margin can be spent on gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly smaller D (3.30) with gamma -3.55 to keep more mass margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":286500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Safer neighbour of the corner that separates the D and gamma effects.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"D3.36 with bl 1.15 at gamma -3.5 to test the mass-margin edge with a slightly less blunt nose.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.15,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the D limit set by heatshield_mass_fraction.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"D3.37 is the predicted mass-fraction boundary, with gamma -3.45 to protect g.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":277000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Boundary probe of the mass-fraction limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-19d65f7d82f4\",\"rationale\":\"Moderate bluntness and cone at D3.32, gamma -3.52.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.32,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.1,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":287000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Interpolates between known feasible points and the corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-19d65f7d82f4\",\"rationale\":\"D3.28 with max bluntness at gamma -3.5 for a safe mass margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.28,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":287700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Low-risk improvement over the current front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bd65eb0949c1\",\"rationale\":\"Isolates the bluntness effect: D3.35, bl 1.0 at gamma -3.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.0,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":287500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Quantifies how much bluntness buys at large D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bd65eb0949c1\",\"rationale\":\"D3.34, bl 1.1, c68 at gamma -3.45 as a robust intermediate.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.34,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.1,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":68.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":282000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front near the corner and tests the c68 mass effect.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"Extend the front toward low flux: D3.35, gamma -2.0 with bl 1.2 and c70 unchanged.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":245000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Larger D should lower flux well below the current 283k minimum.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"Shallower gamma -1.6 at D3.35 for the lowest-flux end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the flux/T trade-off at shallow entry.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point at gamma -2.5 and D3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front between shallow and steep entries.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point at gamma -3.0 and D3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front and checks the gamma sensitivity at large D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"D3.3 at gamma -2.2, a smaller-D variant of the shallow branch.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the D scaling at shallow gamma with more mass margin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-268997241f64\",\"rationale\":\"D3.3, bl 1.2, c70 at gamma -3.3, staying away from the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Safe point that beats C-bd65eb0949c1 (same D and gamma) via higher bluntness.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"Probe bluntness 1.25 at c70 (beyond the tested 1.2) for slightly lower flux and T.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":277000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Small expected gain, with some risk of a no-geometry result. Tells where the bluntness limit lies at c70.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-268997241f64\",\"rationale\":\"D3.33, gamma -3.4 fill point near the corner.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.33,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":280000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Comfortable margins on both g and mass fraction.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4410e4f38167\",\"rationale\":\"Probe the g boundary: gamma -3.58 at D3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":287000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the exact gamma at which max_g reaches 12.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"Extreme shallow end of the front at gamma -1.5 and D3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":418.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether flux keeps dropping at the shallowest allowed gamma and that T stays under 450 K.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-29603553ab30\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point at gamma -2.75 and D3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.75},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves coverage of the trade-off curve.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":224520,"type":"result","duration_ms":271472,"uuid":"e944aec6-6937-4af7-8530-2d8703130b8d","ttft_stream_ms":1406,"time_to_request_ms":249,"first_content_frame_ms":1406,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
